# This directory contains auto-generated class diagrams

Generated using: `php scripts/generate-class-diagram.php`

## Files

- `class-diagram.plantuml` - Complete system diagram (PlantUML format)
- `models.puml` - Domain models only
- `services.puml` - Service layer only
- `controllers.puml` - Controller layer only

## How to View

### Online
- PlantUML: https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/uml/
- Mermaid: https://mermaid.live/

### VSCode
- Install PlantUML extension
- Press `Alt + D` to preview

### Command Line
```bash
plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/*.puml
```
